                MOVE 542587.74 TO CHK-AMOUNT
                MOVE "2010-10-20" TO CHK-DATE
                MOVE "JHXSJH53" TO CHK-SEQ-NUMBER
            WHEN OTHER
                MOVE "10" TO WS-CHK-STATUS
                *> TODO: this program's AT END clause could not be auto-replicated -- add its loop-guard MOVE by hand
        END-EVALUATE
    END-MOCK
